{'symbol': 'REGN', 'date': '2019-10-17 22:30:00', 'title': 'CONSORT SIGNS DEVELOPMENT AGREEMENT WITH REGENERON', 'text': "CONSORT MEDICAL PLC ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEVELOPMENT AGREEMENT INCLUDING KEY COMMERCIAL SUPPLY TERMS WITH REGENERON PHARMACEUTICALS, INC. THE AGREEMENT PROVIDES FOR CONSORT'S PROPRIETARY VAPOURSOFT TECHNOLOGY TO BE INCORPORATED INTO A NOVEL DRUG DELIVERY DEVICE DESIGNED BY REGENERON. IN THE EVENT THAT REGENERON ELECTS TO COMMERCIALISE THE DEVELOPED DEVICE, THE PARTIES WILL ENTER INTO A FULL COMMERCIAL SUPPLY AGREEMENT WITH MANUFACTURING TO BE UNDERTAKEN BY CONSORT FOR BOTH THE VAPOURSOFT TECHNOLOGY AND THE DRUG DELIVERY DEVICE ITSELF. VAPOURSOFT IS ONE OF A RANGE OF NOVEL TECHNOLOGIES DEVELOPED AT CONSORT'S INNOVATION CENTRE BASED IN CAMBRIDGE, UNITED KINGDOM. THROUGH THE USE OF A LIQUID GAS PROPELLANT, RATHER THAN A SPRING TO DRIVE THE DELIVERY OF THE DRUG, VAPOURSOFT FACILITATES DELIVERY OF A BROADER RANGE OF DRUG FORMULATIONS AND VOLUMES."}